      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/alfarata_pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alfarata’s early settlers relied on agriculture, and the town never developed a major industry or landmark beyond its quiet rural setting.",
